the year ahead on the matters covering these resolutions."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Board intends to host a shareholder forum to discuss questions received ahead of the AGM as soon as reasonably practicable and a further announcement will be made in respect of this in due course."]},{"type":"p","children":["Further information on the Company can be found at www.system1group.com."]},{"type":"p","children":["For further information, please contact:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["System1 Group PLC"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Via Alma"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["James Gregory, Chief Executive Officer"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t","\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Chris Willford, Chief Financial Officer"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t","\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Canaccord Genuity Limited (Nominated Adviser \u0026 Broker)"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0)20 7523 8000"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Simon Bridges / Andrew Potts / Harry Rees"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t","\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Alma Strategic Communications"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\